WEBVTT

00:01.260 --> 00:03.130
An elite boy's school.

00:03.300 --> 00:06.270
I transferred after the semester began.

00:06.370 --> 00:09.170
I had no idea what was waiting for me.

00:09.370 --> 00:11.970
I thought it was just a school full of guys...

00:12.210 --> 00:13.510
...but why do I see a girl?

00:13.640 --> 00:14.740
I'm a guy!

00:14.840 --> 00:15.370
Huh?

00:15.480 --> 00:16.710
But that skirt...

00:16.810 --> 00:18.780
What are you saying?
You're going to wear it too.

00:18.880 --> 00:19.350
What?

00:19.450 --> 00:21.640
The three of us are in this together.

00:21.820 --> 00:23.480
Let's do a great job, okay?

00:23.590 --> 00:25.080
No!

00:25.350 --> 00:28.880
And this is how my life as a princess began...

00:30.360 --> 00:36.990
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:37.130 --> 00:43.730
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:44.640 --> 00:49.700
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

00:49.850 --> 00:56.410
<i>I always have them</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

00:57.420 --> 01:02.120
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:02.320 --> 01:07.790
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:10.100 --> 01:15.770
<i>Sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:15.870 --> 01:22.680
<i>...makes my heart beat faster and</i> <i>cuts through the sky like the wind.</i>

01:22.810 --> 01:29.480
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:29.590 --> 01:35.290
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:35.490 --> 01:42.160
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say...</i>

01:42.300 --> 01:47.960
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

01:48.270 --> 01:58.270
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:00.480 --> 02:06.050
<i>Princess is Targeted</i>

02:36.790 --> 02:38.650
Wonderful!

02:38.790 --> 02:42.090
They're like angels sent down from heaven!

02:42.460 --> 02:44.430
I'll definitely find you!

03:02.210 --> 03:03.010
All right!

03:03.110 --> 03:04.670
Wow!

03:04.880 --> 03:06.910
Did you see that, princess?

03:07.080 --> 03:08.380
It was great!

03:08.720 --> 03:10.450
You were awesome!

03:11.850 --> 03:13.910
Work, Mikoto!

03:14.290 --> 03:15.880
Let's go.

03:16.290 --> 03:19.660
I'm making the next shot! Please watch me!

03:19.830 --> 03:20.920
No, watch me!

03:21.060 --> 03:21.830
Watch me!

03:23.200 --> 03:26.100
I guess they're full of energy when the princesses are around.

03:26.400 --> 03:28.230
President Arisada?

03:28.340 --> 03:29.670
Even you, Sakamoto?

03:29.810 --> 03:31.140
Thanks for doing this in such hot weather.

03:31.770 --> 03:32.900
Here's something for you guys.

03:33.010 --> 03:34.480
Thank you!

03:35.040 --> 03:37.070
We're inside, so it's not so bad.

03:37.210 --> 03:39.810
It's when we're outside cheering...

03:40.880 --> 03:42.850
Since we wear this...

03:43.150 --> 03:45.420
It must be hard to work during the summer.

03:45.520 --> 03:47.820
Well, what are you doing here Mr. Sakamoto?

03:47.960 --> 03:49.320
Well...

03:51.990 --> 03:55.590
As a candidate to be the next president of the student association...

03:55.760 --> 03:59.100
...he has to learn a lot during the summer!

04:00.640 --> 04:02.260
It's not easy for Sakamoto either.

04:06.210 --> 04:07.540
Yutaka.

04:07.640 --> 04:10.130
I'm sorry for making you come here during the summer.

04:10.280 --> 04:12.440
But I did say there would be work to do, right?

04:12.580 --> 04:14.570
Please don't give me that look.

04:14.680 --> 04:19.550
Besides, you totally forgot about the princess job until we called you!

04:19.690 --> 04:21.380
I wanted to forget about it...

04:21.790 --> 04:23.520
You're not getting off that easy!

04:23.630 --> 04:27.690
You can't just make us do this on our own, we're in this thing together!

04:27.830 --> 04:30.530
Well, it's time to go cheer for the other clubs.

04:30.700 --> 04:31.670
Let me go!

04:31.800 --> 04:33.260
I'll do it!

04:32.500 --> 04:33.260
<i>Wait!</i>

04:34.770 --> 04:36.930
Looks like your foundation is coming off.

04:37.040 --> 04:37.560
What?

04:37.970 --> 04:40.270
It comes off easily when you sweat.

04:40.410 --> 04:43.280
Go to the princess only dressing room and fix it.

04:43.380 --> 04:45.510
Princesses have to look nice all the time.

04:45.610 --> 04:47.280
We'll do that...

04:47.420 --> 04:48.680
Wait, you guys...

04:48.850 --> 04:53.250
Mr. Sakamoto, go with them for future reference.

04:53.920 --> 04:54.860
Yes!

04:59.090 --> 05:01.890
<i>Princess only dressing room</i>

05:02.130 --> 05:04.030
It's certainly sticking to my face.

05:04.130 --> 05:06.690
The last one we used was much better.

05:06.900 --> 05:09.460
But this one is more natural.

05:10.070 --> 05:11.230
No more!

05:11.370 --> 05:15.400
Why is it that we high school boys have to know a lot about makeup?

05:15.540 --> 05:17.510
We need it for our job.

05:17.710 --> 05:19.240
It's not all that bad.

05:19.350 --> 05:19.870
What?

05:19.980 --> 05:22.040
You can give advice to your girlfriend.

05:22.150 --> 05:26.250
No, Megumi doesn't seem to like makeup that much.

05:26.520 --> 05:29.050
She looks better without makeup...

05:29.190 --> 05:32.750
So your girlfriend's name is Megumi?

05:33.090 --> 05:35.620
She looks better without makeup!

05:35.730 --> 05:37.200
S-Shihoudani!

05:37.330 --> 05:39.960
Plus she's older than you?

05:40.070 --> 05:40.760
Really?

05:40.870 --> 05:43.810
Then she probably dominates him all the time, I feel sorry for him.

05:44.310 --> 05:45.600
That's enough!

05:46.340 --> 05:47.470
Are you guys done?

05:47.610 --> 05:49.310
Yeah. Sorry to keep you waiting.

05:49.440 --> 05:50.840
We got work to do.

05:50.950 --> 05:52.540
Don't ignore me!

06:05.030 --> 06:06.760
What's wrong, Tohru?

06:07.060 --> 06:10.930
Well, I just thought someone was watching me.

06:18.370 --> 06:20.040
There's nobody out there.

06:20.140 --> 06:21.610
Maybe it was just my imagination.

06:21.710 --> 06:22.540
What's wrong?

06:22.640 --> 06:24.810
It's nothing.

06:24.950 --> 06:26.810
Let's go someplace cool!

06:27.150 --> 06:29.580
Hey, why are you so anxious to do this now?

06:29.680 --> 06:30.620
Shut up!

06:30.720 --> 06:33.050
I just don't want to walk around wearing this thing!

06:33.220 --> 06:35.250
Kouno! We're going!

06:36.120 --> 06:37.560
Wait for me!

06:43.630 --> 06:45.600
<i>Home economics room</i>

07:04.850 --> 07:06.790
What is this?

07:06.920 --> 07:08.150
Who would do such a thing?

07:08.260 --> 07:09.880
Those are our wardrobes...

07:10.030 --> 07:11.190
No! Don't go inside!

07:12.260 --> 07:13.230
Sakamoto?

07:13.360 --> 07:15.130
We have to keep the evidence intact!

07:15.260 --> 07:18.600
Plus there might be something dangerous inside!

07:18.800 --> 07:20.890
Let's get President Arisada!

07:21.070 --> 07:23.270
Our next president seems to know what he's doing!

07:23.370 --> 07:24.030
What?

07:24.140 --> 07:25.470
I told you I'm not...

07:25.570 --> 07:26.440
Amazing.

07:26.540 --> 07:27.130
That's right.

07:33.650 --> 07:35.670
There's nobody here, Arisada.

07:36.280 --> 07:38.750
There's nothing wrong with the princess wardrobes, it's perfectly clean.

07:39.320 --> 07:41.850
But so many roses...

07:41.990 --> 07:44.120
They must've cost a lot.

07:44.260 --> 07:45.190
What a waste.

07:45.290 --> 07:47.560
I don't think that's important right now.

07:47.700 --> 07:51.860
You did the right thing by telling us, Mr. Sakamoto.

07:52.330 --> 07:54.390
If the other students found out about this, it would've been chaotic...

07:54.500 --> 07:57.230
...and the situation would've gotten out of control.

07:57.370 --> 08:01.570
No, it's just that we didn't know what to do.

08:01.710 --> 08:02.730
I see.

08:02.880 --> 08:04.110
What?

08:04.210 --> 08:06.040
Nothing.

08:06.380 --> 08:08.940
Some members of the home economics club were absent today.

08:09.080 --> 08:10.280
Where's Natashou?

08:10.390 --> 08:11.380
I haven't seen him today.

08:11.490 --> 08:14.790
Then we can say it was done by someone outside of the clubs.

08:14.890 --> 08:18.050
Don't you think it was a malicious act, Arisada?

08:18.490 --> 08:20.330
Could it be a stalker?

08:20.700 --> 08:21.630
Stalker?

08:22.060 --> 08:23.830
It hasn't been proven yet.

08:23.970 --> 08:27.230
Maybe someone was just nice enough to deliver a bunch of flowers.

08:27.370 --> 08:28.770
That's ridiculous...

08:28.870 --> 08:30.300
I'm just saying it's a possibility.

08:31.440 --> 08:34.770
Well, you just leave the rest to us.

08:34.910 --> 08:38.140
You guys go on and continue with your princess job.

08:38.280 --> 08:38.940
But...

08:39.050 --> 08:39.810
Mikoto!

08:39.950 --> 08:40.920
What?

08:41.020 --> 08:42.640
We're the ones being targeted!

08:42.750 --> 08:44.950
Even if we stay here, we're not helping them at all!

08:45.050 --> 08:46.890
Besides, we have to get back to work!

08:46.990 --> 08:48.320
Just as I thought.

08:47.890 --> 08:48.320
<i>What?</i>

08:48.820 --> 08:50.620
We were being watched back there!

08:51.960 --> 08:52.950
What's wrong?

08:53.060 --> 08:58.090
Not too long ago, Kouno said someone was watching him from outside...

08:59.670 --> 09:01.400
Today's princess job is cancelled.

09:01.570 --> 09:03.540
Please go back to your dorms and wait.

09:03.810 --> 09:06.870
Mr. Sakamoto, can you walk them to their dorms?

09:07.010 --> 09:08.270
Y-Yes...

09:08.940 --> 09:11.670
First, get a hold of the members of the home economics club.

09:11.780 --> 09:12.750
Got it!

09:12.950 --> 09:14.680
And search everywhere within the premises.

09:14.780 --> 09:15.220
Okay!

09:30.370 --> 09:33.270
Hey, what was that all about this afternoon?

09:34.070 --> 09:35.560
Well...

09:36.100 --> 09:39.070
Maybe it was just a present for all of us.

09:39.170 --> 09:40.230
I don't think so.

09:40.340 --> 09:40.810
What?

09:41.480 --> 09:43.380
Why do you say that?

09:43.510 --> 09:45.950
I thought people admired us princesses.

09:46.080 --> 09:47.950
So it's not weird for us to receive gifts, right?

09:48.050 --> 09:51.540
It's against the rules for us to receive personal gifts.

09:51.820 --> 09:52.480
Why?

09:52.820 --> 09:57.560
If it wasn't, then this room would be filled with tons of gifts by now.

09:57.690 --> 10:00.960
I see, you might be right.

10:01.460 --> 10:02.430
Then...

10:03.430 --> 10:06.370
I guess the guy you saw this afternoon...

10:07.740 --> 10:11.140
I thought I saw someone...

10:14.780 --> 10:16.940
By the way, where's Mikoto?

10:17.110 --> 10:18.080
What?

10:32.930 --> 10:34.950
Yeah, that's right...

10:35.360 --> 10:38.860
Looks like it's going to take longer than expected.

10:40.740 --> 10:43.570
Yeah, I'll come home as soon as I'm done.

10:44.170 --> 10:46.200
Yeah, I know.

10:46.410 --> 10:49.430
Okay, good night Megumi!

10:57.020 --> 10:59.490
Talking to your girlfriend, huh?

10:59.990 --> 11:02.580
I guess you didn't tell her about the princess job.

11:02.690 --> 11:04.590
How could I tell her such a thing!

11:04.690 --> 11:05.850
Why?

11:05.990 --> 11:08.550
You shouldn't hide things from her.

11:09.230 --> 11:10.790
That's right.

11:10.900 --> 11:15.340
If you can't tell her the truth, then your relationship is based on a lie!

11:15.500 --> 11:19.100
You don't have to hide anything in this relationship, right?

11:19.210 --> 11:20.510
That's right.

11:20.610 --> 11:22.130
Shut up!

11:22.410 --> 11:24.610
It's easy for you to say since you have no girlfriend!

11:24.780 --> 11:26.180
I see.

11:27.420 --> 11:28.610
Can I tell her?

11:30.420 --> 11:33.790
Can I tell her everything?

11:36.520 --> 11:38.990
I'm sorry! I was wrong!

11:39.430 --> 11:41.560
Good. As long as you understand.

11:41.700 --> 11:44.720
Well, the summer is almost over.

11:44.870 --> 11:48.800
If you really want to visit her, then go ahead.

11:49.040 --> 11:51.670
Tohru, why are you being so nice to him?

11:51.810 --> 11:52.800
I can't go back.

11:52.910 --> 11:53.600
What?

11:54.140 --> 11:56.370
If there really is a stalker out there...

11:56.580 --> 12:01.980
...then the ones around me, ones that I love will be in danger.

12:02.150 --> 12:03.450
Mikoto...

12:03.550 --> 12:07.080
If something happens to Megumi...

12:07.990 --> 12:12.020
You really love your girlfriend, huh?

12:12.460 --> 12:15.900
What about you people? Haven't you ever had girlfriends?

12:17.000 --> 12:19.160
I'm still looking!

12:19.270 --> 12:21.030
Sorry to tell you that I don't have one!

12:21.140 --> 12:23.970
Well, I don't have one right now, either.

12:24.110 --> 12:25.270
Really?

12:25.410 --> 12:28.000
You guys have no problem picking up girls, right?

12:28.140 --> 12:31.240
We won't be picking up girls for a while...

12:43.560 --> 12:45.320
Princesses!

12:45.830 --> 12:46.820
We heard about it!

12:46.930 --> 12:50.760
Don't worry! We'll protect you!

12:51.000 --> 12:52.430
Well...

12:52.630 --> 12:54.600
You guys came back to school just for that?

12:54.700 --> 12:55.930
Looks like it.

12:56.040 --> 12:57.770
We're going to assign who will be on the lookout!

12:57.940 --> 12:59.200
Yeah!

12:59.370 --> 13:00.670
This place was targeted too.

13:00.780 --> 13:01.440
What?

13:02.540 --> 13:04.880
It was placed near the entrance this morning.

13:14.020 --> 13:17.250
Arisada warned us about it, so we were being very careful, but...

13:17.360 --> 13:19.090
Don't worry about it, princesses!

13:19.360 --> 13:21.560
We won't let anyone lay a finger on you!

13:21.660 --> 13:24.000
We'll put our lives on the line to protect you!

13:24.300 --> 13:25.770
I see...

13:25.970 --> 13:28.700
In return, we'd like to ask you for a favor...

13:28.800 --> 13:29.570
What?

13:29.670 --> 13:33.630
To protect our sacred hearts, provide us with mercy...

13:33.740 --> 13:34.300
Mercy?

13:34.410 --> 13:37.110
Provide us with mercy, princess!

13:37.880 --> 13:39.940
Hey, they're talking about that thing.

13:40.080 --> 13:42.710
Oh, you mean that?

13:42.850 --> 13:43.980
Mikoto, you too, okay?

13:44.090 --> 13:44.780
What?

13:46.150 --> 13:49.180
Thank you everyone!

13:50.760 --> 13:52.520
I'm happy to be alive!

13:52.630 --> 13:54.150
Thank you princesses!

13:58.130 --> 14:01.030
<i>Student association room</i>

13:58.700 --> 14:01.030
And did you find out anything?

14:01.270 --> 14:02.170
No.

14:02.400 --> 14:06.340
But it looks like no one from outside came into our school.

14:06.470 --> 14:08.500
About the flowers that were delivered to the dorms...

14:08.610 --> 14:13.550
I contacted the flower shop and they said some young man ordered them.

14:13.680 --> 14:14.980
Young man?

14:15.120 --> 14:16.240
What about his name?

14:16.350 --> 14:18.480
Unfortunately, we couldn't get it...

14:18.790 --> 14:21.690
Then we have no idea who it is...

14:21.820 --> 14:24.350
He hasn't caused any actual harm...

14:24.490 --> 14:27.590
...but I wonder what he intends to do by sending flowers...

14:27.860 --> 14:32.060
If it's only a present, then he'll just be punished for breaking the rules.

14:32.370 --> 14:35.460
There was a guy who broke the rules when I was a princess.

14:35.570 --> 14:36.160
What?

14:37.310 --> 14:42.570
He came from a wealthy family, but he kept sending presents everyday.

14:42.710 --> 14:45.910
Even if I refused, he'd tell me
I'm just embarrassed by the attention.

14:46.010 --> 14:48.110
Some people like to play with your mind.

14:48.720 --> 14:50.410
Wow, that's like...

14:50.520 --> 14:52.710
Then what happened?

14:53.720 --> 14:57.660
Of course, I had a nice long chat with him.

15:00.960 --> 15:02.990
He sure was stupid.

15:03.100 --> 15:05.070
He was naïve.

15:05.200 --> 15:09.530
No, no, he just didn't know his place.

15:09.900 --> 15:12.840
I wonder what they talked about...

15:13.240 --> 15:16.440
I want to know, but then again I don't want to know...

15:17.150 --> 15:20.510
Umm, did you find any other clues?

15:20.650 --> 15:21.840
Nothing more.

15:21.950 --> 15:24.250
But there is a way to catch the culprit.

15:24.350 --> 15:25.050
What?

15:25.150 --> 15:28.650
If he doesn't show himself, then we'll just use bait to lure him in.

15:28.760 --> 15:29.280
What?

15:29.490 --> 15:32.120
Then we have to be the bait?

15:32.230 --> 15:34.750
Of course, we don't want anything to happen to you guys.

15:34.860 --> 15:36.090
You will have security.

15:36.230 --> 15:37.390
Yes, but...

15:37.530 --> 15:38.330
I understand!

15:38.430 --> 15:39.230
What?

15:39.430 --> 15:40.300
I'll do it!

15:40.400 --> 15:42.060
Are you serious, Mikoto?

15:42.340 --> 15:44.400
I don't want this to go on any longer!

15:47.410 --> 15:48.340
Fine.

15:49.040 --> 15:51.010
President, I'll do it too.

15:51.150 --> 15:51.810
Kouno?

15:51.910 --> 15:52.710
Me too.

15:52.810 --> 15:54.010
You too, Shihoudani?

15:54.350 --> 15:57.720
We're in this thing together, remember?

15:57.950 --> 15:59.390
Shihoudani...

15:59.550 --> 16:00.820
So that's it.

16:00.920 --> 16:02.650
It'll be a pleasure working with you, Mikoto!

16:02.920 --> 16:03.690
Kouno...

16:18.940 --> 16:21.240
We don't know when he might show up.

16:21.380 --> 16:22.340
Be careful!

16:22.480 --> 16:23.270
Okay!

16:24.910 --> 16:26.940
Princesses! Good luck with your jobs!

16:27.080 --> 16:29.310
Yay! I'm glad I took classes in summer!

16:29.550 --> 16:30.420
Right?

16:30.520 --> 16:32.450
I never thought I'd see them during the summer!

16:32.720 --> 16:35.710
Good luck with your studies!

16:35.920 --> 16:37.190
Yes!

16:37.590 --> 16:38.750
What's going on?

16:39.030 --> 16:40.360
Sorry about that.

16:40.500 --> 16:43.660
But we can't do anything about our regular students.

16:43.830 --> 16:45.300
Please do a good job.

16:45.900 --> 16:47.430
We'll do a better job next time.

17:06.950 --> 17:08.080
We didn't see him.

17:08.490 --> 17:10.820
Are you sure there was a suspicious-looking guy?

17:11.490 --> 17:13.050
You saw the flowers, didn't you?

17:13.190 --> 17:15.060
I did but...

17:17.930 --> 17:18.730
It's him!

17:18.830 --> 17:20.430
I was finally able to meet you!

17:21.140 --> 17:22.260
Capture him!

17:24.640 --> 17:25.900
Are you guys okay?

17:26.010 --> 17:26.800
Yeah...

17:27.140 --> 17:29.080
Hey, stay still!

17:29.240 --> 17:30.370
You guys!

17:30.480 --> 17:31.580
Hey!

17:30.980 --> 17:33.310
<i>You guys want to be idols?</i>

17:36.480 --> 17:37.280
Huh?

17:37.550 --> 17:38.210
Idol?

17:38.990 --> 17:39.320
<i>Teen talent scout.. Kohji Asano</i>

17:39.320 --> 17:40.950
Nice to meet you.
<i>Teen talent scout: Kohji Asano</i>

17:41.890 --> 17:43.880
Entertainment production?

17:44.490 --> 17:45.220
Yes.

17:45.330 --> 17:50.060
When I went to one of your school's games, I saw 3 cuties.

17:50.500 --> 17:53.700
We definitely want you people to work with us.

17:53.800 --> 17:56.200
So I went around and did some research.

18:06.310 --> 18:09.280
But I couldn't get any info on you people.

18:09.520 --> 18:12.080
I saw you cheering at this school, so...

18:12.520 --> 18:14.890
I kept an eye on you thinking that you might be the same group.

18:14.990 --> 18:16.480
I was right.

18:17.690 --> 18:20.860
You took this picture?

18:21.700 --> 18:23.060
Don't worry.

18:23.260 --> 18:26.170
If you're wearing that wig, nobody will know.

18:26.270 --> 18:27.630
Really?

18:27.740 --> 18:29.290
Trust me.

18:30.570 --> 18:34.270
I'd like for you to explain those flowers you sent.

18:34.380 --> 18:37.370
Flowers? I had nothing to do with that.

18:38.010 --> 18:39.110
What?

18:39.610 --> 18:43.140
I was just waiting for you guys to come outside.

18:43.420 --> 18:45.050
I didn't do anything else.

18:45.820 --> 18:47.910
Then who sent those flowers?

18:58.370 --> 19:00.100
Yahoo!

19:01.940 --> 19:04.960
There you are, princesses!

19:05.440 --> 19:06.410
Here.

19:06.540 --> 19:06.940
What's this?

19:07.140 --> 19:07.840
Here.

19:07.980 --> 19:08.940
Here.

19:11.450 --> 19:14.310
N-Natasho, what's the meaning of this?

19:14.480 --> 19:15.850
Yes, yes, yes!

19:16.180 --> 19:17.910
Imagining it just won't cut it!

19:18.020 --> 19:22.150
The real princesses along with the roses creates this inspiration!

19:22.720 --> 19:26.990
Natasho, are these flowers for the new wardrobes?

19:27.090 --> 19:28.360
That's right!

19:28.460 --> 19:31.400
The new wardrobes go with the image of a rose!

19:31.500 --> 19:34.900
So I was looking at it by combining the previous wardrobes with the rose...

19:35.000 --> 19:36.560
...but it just wasn't good enough!

19:42.940 --> 19:46.850
I left a bunch of flowers at your dorms, but you didn't bring them with you!

19:46.950 --> 19:49.310
So I had to go buy some more!

19:49.420 --> 19:51.250
He sure raised a false alarm.

19:51.390 --> 19:52.250
He sure did.

19:52.350 --> 19:54.320
Now I have the image in my head!

19:54.420 --> 19:56.720
I have to get to work!

19:57.060 --> 19:59.860
But we're glad to know who was behind it.

20:00.060 --> 20:01.460
I guess...

20:01.760 --> 20:03.920
Good job, princesses.

20:04.100 --> 20:06.260
We'll take care of the rest.

20:06.400 --> 20:07.930
Aren't you glad, Mikoto?

20:08.100 --> 20:08.830
What?

20:08.970 --> 20:12.030
Now you can go on a date with your girlfriend without any worries.

20:12.140 --> 20:13.130
Yeah, thanks.

20:13.810 --> 20:15.570
Excuse me, but...

20:15.710 --> 20:18.040
What does that mean, "a date with your girlfriend?"

20:18.350 --> 20:21.080
Well, let's talk about the details over there.

20:21.920 --> 20:24.510
I still have a lot more to ask you.

20:25.390 --> 20:27.450
This way please.

20:25.890 --> 20:27.450
<i>Wait a minute!</i>

20:27.690 --> 20:31.630
Hey, you all can definitely be top idols!

20:31.730 --> 20:33.700
Hey, think about it, okay?

20:33.860 --> 20:35.690
Hey!

20:49.780 --> 20:52.680
He looks really happy...

20:52.780 --> 20:55.840
Hey, let's get closer so we can see her face.

20:55.950 --> 20:56.580
Yeah.

20:56.680 --> 20:58.310
Hey girls!

20:58.420 --> 21:02.150
What are you doing? Are you girls free right now?

21:02.360 --> 21:05.350
Do you want to go karaoke with us?

21:05.860 --> 21:06.690
Not again...

21:06.760 --> 21:08.750
Are we cursed or something?

21:09.800 --> 21:10.460
He's gone!

21:10.560 --> 21:11.730
Hey girl!

21:11.830 --> 21:14.270
It's hot, so we can go to some restaurant...

21:14.370 --> 21:16.270
What are you going to do?

21:16.540 --> 21:18.440
We lost sight of him!

21:18.540 --> 21:20.530
Can you take the blame?

21:41.930 --> 21:49.500
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.600 --> 21:57.670
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:58.180 --> 22:05.520
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.620 --> 22:13.360
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.490 --> 22:23.490
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.740 --> 22:30.340
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.680 --> 22:32.170
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:32.310 --> 22:40.050
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:40.150 --> 22:46.150
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.290 --> 22:48.320
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.600 --> 22:58.600
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>

23:05.850 --> 23:10.080
Next Episode, Secret of the Sakamoto Family
